		"description": "<p>Foul magic guides your blade. As an action, make a melee weapon attack and apply a minor curse to your target on a successful hit. This curse lasts for up to 1 minute and causes your target to become [[/condition id=rattled]] for the duration. If your target is already under the effects of a curse, they take an additional 1d4 necrotic damage from your attack. Your target can make a Charisma save at the end of each of their turns to end this effect.</p>",
